{"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "legendre", "ucas": "legendre 2 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "legendre", "a_quadratic_residue": "x^2 = a has a solution", "method": "quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)", "lhs": "(2/7)", "value": "1", "value_int": 1, "headline": "(2/7) = 1", "details": ["(4^2 = 2 mod 7)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "Euler's criterion 2^((7-1)/2) = 1 mod 7"}], "files": [], "text": "(2/7) = 1\n  a quadratic residue: x^2 = a has a solution\n  (4^2 = 2 mod 7)\n  how: quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)\n  check: Euler's criterion 2^((7-1)/2) = 1 mod 7\n"}
